allows a certain range of
movement at the joints.

473
00:30:44,660 --> 00:30:48,200
That interosseous membrane
is the dura mater.

474
00:30:49,120 --> 00:30:55,360
And then this from Anne being
a hugely important concept

475
00:30:55,360 --> 00:30:59,680
that the ligamentous articular
mechanism is essentially

476
00:30:59,680 --> 00:31:04,300
a concept of the skeleton,
the bones and the membranes

477
00:31:04,300 --> 00:31:07,680
that bind them, as
being independent of the

478
00:31:07,680 --> 00:31:13,420
neuromuscular system that moves
