655
00:43:35,040 --> 00:43:38,620
then during exhalation,
it would be the opposite.

656
00:43:38,760 --> 00:43:41,840
And then finally, we come
to the fluctuation of

657
00:43:41,840 --> 00:43:45,300
the cerebrospinal fluid,
the potency of the tide,

658
00:43:45,300 --> 00:43:49,080
that being A, because
there's a physiological

659
00:43:49,080 --> 00:43:53,220
potency, and B, because
this is really what he

660
00:43:53,220 --> 00:43:56,910
thought was driving
the primary respiratory

661
00:43:56,910 --> 00:44:00,460
mechanism, he would say,
as the thing that makes it

662
00:44:00,460 --> 00:44:06,640
move. So we'll start with
the concept of fluctuation

663
00:44:06,640 --> 00:44:10,140
and why it's so important,
remembering that

664
00:44:10,660 --> 00:44:14,820
in the BLT, I kind of
brought up the thought

665
00:44:14,820 --> 00:44:18,320
that the goal of an
osteopathic treatment is to

666
00:44:18,320 --> 00:44:21,760
promote the interchange
of fluid. So let's kind

667
00:44:21,760 --> 00:44:24,200
of take a look at the
concept of fluctuation.

668
00:44:24,440 --> 00:44:27,360
Remember that this is
something that happens

669
00:44:27,360 --> 00:44:31,420
everywhere in the body
and why it's so important.

670
00:44:31,420 --> 00:44:34,460
So fluctuation differs
from circulation.

671
00:44:35,000 --> 00:44:37,280
Circulation is the
movement of fluid

672
00:44:37,280 --> 00:44:40,460
into a place and
out of the place.

673
00:44:40,860 --> 00:44:44,700
Fluctuation, again, no
change in volume, so you

674
00:44:44,700 --> 00:44:47,420
don't displace the fluid,
you just kind of move

675
00:44:47,420 --> 00:44:50,400
it back and forth. He
likened that movement to

676
00:44:50,400 --> 00:44:54,120
the movement of the tide,
which moves the ocean

677
00:44:54,120 --> 00:44:58,360
water kind of back and
forth in a regular rhythm.

678
00:44:59,200 --> 00:45:03,380
And I'm going to introduce
the idea to you that

679
00:45:03,380 --> 00:45:08,760
circulation is not
sufficient for exchange,

680
00:45:08,760 --> 00:45:11,240
that sort of
interchange that needs

681
00:45:11,240 --> 00:45:14,320
to happen with every
cell in our body.

682
00:45:14,320 --> 00:45:17,420
Every cell in our body
needs to bring in nutrients,

683
00:45:17,420 --> 00:45:21,000
needs to bring in oxygen,
and needs to get rid of

684
00:45:21,000 --> 00:45:26,780
